sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as HTML channel test interface
    participant W as WebSocket API and subscription handler
    participant Q as HTTP query API/Lambda
    participant DB as Same DynamoDB event source and routing metadata
    participant N as Notification Lambda
    Note over C,W: One demo JWT session, backend IAM stays separate, no token secrets in event frames
    C->>W: Attempt authenticated live transport
    alt WebSocket is unavailable
        W-->>C: Live observation disconnected
        Note over C,Q: Explicit HTTP payment remains permitted if HTTP authentication and required storage are healthy
        C->>Q: Optional explicit retained-history request
        Q->>DB: Read same consultable event source
        DB-->>Q: Retained records or expiry/gap information
        Q-->>C: Historical knowledge, not a new payment instruction
    else Live transport is available
        W-->>C: Ready with current connection epoch
        Note over C,Q: Use actual transactionId from admitted HTTP result or existing history, never invent one
        C->>W: Subscribe with requestId, subscriptionId and immutable transaction/context tuple
        W->>DB: Conditionally install technical subscription binding/generation
        DB-->>W: Routing installed, no second event/history payload
        opt Matching event arrives before ACK
            DB--)N: Streams event-insertion signal
            N->>W: Notification for current subscription binding
            W-->>C: Live frame may duplicate or precede ACK
            Note over C: Buffer only, do not render before matching ACK
        end
        W->>DB: Strong read of observed source head A after routing installation
        DB-->>W: Observed A and retention metadata
        W-->>C: ACK matching request, target, epoch and generation, observed A
        Note over C,W: Identical subscribe retry gets same ACK, retarget conflicts do not rebind
        C->>Q: Start source catch-up after last covered sequence
        Q->>DB: Strongly acquire snapshot H at least A and expiry revision
        DB-->>Q: Snapshot head H fixed for this page set
        Q-->>C: Snapshot metadata and bound cursor
        loop Bounded pages up to fixed H
            C->>Q: Query next page, never a payment POST
            Q->>DB: Read retained event rows from same source up to H
            DB-->>Q: Rows and explicit expired or unexplained gap ranges
            Q-->>C: Page and cursor, never silent omission
        end
        C->>C: Validate binding, deduplicate and merge buffered frames with source order
        opt New event after H
            DB--)N: Streams signal, source event retained once
            N->>W: Best-effort at-least-once notification attempt
            W-->>C: Event frame, possibly repeated
            C->>C: Deduplicate or query source on a gap
        end
        opt Disconnect, expired JWT or silent callback loss
            C->>W: Reconnect/renew session or request WebSocket head sync
            W-->>C: New epoch on reconnect, or current observed head on sync
            Note over C,Q: Repeat bound subscribe/ACK then fixed snapshot catch-up, never resubmit payment
        end
        opt Cursor or retained history has expired
            Q-->>C: Resync required with explicit truncation/expired ranges
            C->>Q: Start fresh bounded retained-source snapshot
            Note over C,DB: Approved seven-day functional history expiry does not delete business/evidence references
        end
    end
    Note over DB,N: Streams retention is 24h, reconnect reads retained event table, not a second history projection
    Note over C,N: No unbounded offline-browser delivery queue, missing task observations remain visible gaps
